---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/dredfern.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Healing with Repetitive Beats"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		While I cannot propert to cure any particular illness I would assert the great house music all by itself can help people with health cand wellness, especially when combined with dance or even limited body movement for the disabled.
	</p>

	<p>
		Since I was a young Dj and a guitarist with bands in the 90s I had some basic, foundational values. Having studied Zen Buddism I had the concept of taking refuge, which means to dedicate all our actions to thhe benefit of all sentinent beings in all of existance.
	</p>

	<p>
		I believe in respect for others as well as total inclusiveness with no one ever left out. When I run my own parties these are the total opposite of say Studio 54. However as a Buddhist I am dedicated to non-violance and hope to heal the planet rather than bend it to my will.
	</p>

</Layout>
